  "name": "capturetonkeli – Wi-Fi capture dongle",
  "short_name": "capturetonkeli",
  "description": "Monitor-mode Wi-Fi capture with an ESP32-C5 USB dongle (receive-only): packet list, filters, pcapng recording, FPV video from hx-esp32-cam-fpv and OpenHD drones. Works offline; on Android connect the dongle with a USB OTG adapter.",
